## Educational Purpose

The references listed above are intended to help readers explore the underlying physiological concepts discussed in this repository.

The project combines publicly available medical knowledge with the author's educational interpretation and personal experience living with diabetes.

Readers are encouraged to consult current scientific literature and official clinical guidelines for the most up-to-date information.
